WorldInfo {
  info [
    "Nine rooms of the COLD-Freiburg lab from the Project 3 notebook, built from official Cyberbotics Webots assets."
    "The Supervisor controller imports main.py and turns the student's control tape, policy and factor-graph MPE into robot motion."
    "Room lights differ per room; the light sensor on the iRobot Create is the only source of the dark/medium/light readings."
    "Generated by instructor/tools/make_world.py from vacuum_logic.py (room centers, doorways); do not hand-edit coordinates."
  ]
  title "CS 3630 Project 3 - Vacuum robot in the Freiburg lab"
}
